data: {"id": "9cc2878325534f0d-thinking-parallel_evidence-1350", "run_id": "9cc2878325534f0d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 已采集事实与因果分析\n\n1.  **异常状态确认**：\n    *   **Pod 状态**：`aiops-case-v10/workload` 处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态，`Ready: False`。\n    *   **重启趋势**：重启计数已达 **13** 次，Kubernetes 事件显示 `Back-off restarting failed container` 已经持续 45 分钟。\n\n2.  **根因证据（Exit 78 + 缺失配置）**：\n    *   **Exit Code**：容器以 **Exit Code 78** 终止。在 Kubernetes 中，Exit Code 78 通常代表 `CONFIG_ERROR` 或 `UNAVAILABLE`，表示程序因配置缺失或不可用而主动退出。\n    *   **退出原因 (Reason)**：Last State Reason 为 `Error`，非 `OOMKilled`（137）或 `Completed`（0）。\n    *   **命令与日志**：\n        *   ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789142695624, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "9cc2878325534f0d-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "9cc2878325534f0d", "seq": 1351, "ts_ms": 1789142705851, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 49.721, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v10", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/9cc2878325534f0d-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "d992f84242a7b9c8c3a6536489c419a890d8703b64c0c3eea1346bd7c4e8c76e", "bytes": 2420}, "snapshot_sha256": "579ac9aaa2d9cafefd2d7b12d7ae3dc32236af258f1cdd5c0d58b4712a518427"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

